annot\nexpress four passes, and verify.py:269 silently disables the Pass-2/Pass-4 downgrade for any non-default\nmodel), a574 (review-bot container resolves NO region, so a Bedrock cutover hard-fails NoRegionError),\n1903 (temperature table missed rebar's own DEFAULT_MODEL), 7a79, db1c, c6c9, plus c083 which has LANDED.\n\nNEXT: a574 and 3768 are the only unblocked work; 3768 unblocks both remaining stories. S6 must NOT run\nits corpus (~3,200 billable calls) until 3768 lands, or the two arms differ in provider AND per-pass\nmodel class and the result is unattributable."},"env_id":"ade0f2ef-51cc-45a2-bb97-c09846cd3df5","event_type":"COMMENT","timestamp":1785461796067679001,"uuid":"89953039-6aaf-4454-af0d-f37731c0e5d9"}